{"id":103980862080286,"name":"[🤖] Build to Survive the Robots 2","desc":"🎃 BOMBTOBER EVENT SOON! 🎃\nRSVP here: https://www.roblox.com/events/7500971937666040595\n\nRobots have taken over the world! Survive as a human, or join forces and hunt them down as a robot!\n\n⚔️ How To Play ⚔️\n1. Build a base before nightfall\n2. Fight and survive the robots until the morning\n3. Don’t die, or you will become a robot!\n\n🎮 Controls 🎮\n- Shift (LT on console): sprint/activate ability\n- RMB (L3 on console): aim down sights\n- G (D-Pad down on console): open shop\n- Long click: auto-build/delete\n\n💡 Tips 💡\n• Purchase better items and upgrade their stats in the shop\n• Build high, use strong materials, and layer blocks together for maximum protection\n• Destroy all connected foundations of a base to knock it down as a robot\n• Test different designs on sandbox servers, which features build saving & infinite blocks\n\nPrivate servers include free admin commands! 🙂","path":"/game/103980862080286-build-to-survive-the-robots-2","slug":"103980862080286-build-to-survive-the-robots-2","thumbnail":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/f7264124832b42e190560cb0db3d005848b4231122cdc0a0fed61467a5cda7f4.webp","original":"https://tr.rbxcdn.com/180DAY-fde48df5d66a8860d0fa82707bb233c0/150/150/Image/Png/noFilter"},"playing":90,"visitor":9129368,"verified":false,"updatedAt":"2025-05-31T21:16:43.949Z","creator":{"name":"SheriffTaco","type":"User"},"script":{"count":1,"freeCount":1,"keyCount":1,"verifiedCount":0},"page":1,"next":null,"total":1,"scripts":[{"slug":"Build-to-Survive-the-Robots-2-Build-To-Survive-The-Robots-2-Script-41499","_id":"683b71bbc49eba9c894e31a5","title":"Script","game":{"_id":"68168c2aaafe4b1b916192d1","gameId":103980862080286,"name":"[🤖] Build to Survive the Robots 2","imageUrl":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/no-game.webp","original":null},"thumbnail":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/no-game.webp","original":null},"placeId":103980862080286},"features":"- Aimbot for projectile w